[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429319\">5040C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429580\">7040A74</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429572\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429437\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429442\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429601\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429574\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429122\">2125A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429578\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429364\">5505A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429330\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429454\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429571\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429331\">5040D20</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts and separate the bulb support.</p><p>2. Release the electrical connections (2a, 2b, 2c) and keep the\nbulb support.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning / heater controls light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428402\">G45A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning / heater controls light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428404\">G45B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning / heater controls light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428406\">G45C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044896.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the flap operating cables (1a) from the retainers\n(1b).</p><p>2. Separate the controls support disconnecting the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Climate control fan control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428443\">H81</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044897.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the controls mounting\nis not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection and position\nthe support.</p><p>Connect the flap operating cables to the\nretainers.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections for\nthe bulb support and fasten in place using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429331\">5040D20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429571\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429454\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429330\">5040D18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429364\">5505A25</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429578\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429122\">2125A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429574\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429601\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429602\">7040L22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429603\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429442\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429437\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429572\">7040A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429580\">7040A74</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429319\">5040C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2429576\">7040A26</a></p><p>Check that the ventilation controls are\nworking.</p>"]]